{"title":"2006 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the multiplication problem below <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> are different digits. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/3/b831312585cb4ab6697896f86b72accbddbc4b45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A+B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" />? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/8/c98496cee54a981529919a464508835b9321f88e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{array}{cccc}&amp; A &amp; B &amp; A\\\\ \\times &amp; &amp; C &amp; D\\\\ \\hline C &amp; D &amp; C &amp; D\\\\ \\end{array}\\]\" width=\"127\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/2/102989cd7c2a81c5bbef0ac5bbe5d6377cce6aa6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 2\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 3\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 4\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"351\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/5/fc5e8ff0364f8af96ebe812e46ad4a0a8b64fcc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CDCD = CD \\odot 101$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"165\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/d/e3de8fcd30f418ff04ccfdf27a58fdde7fa9b01c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABA = 101$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"92\" height=\"13\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/3/da3d600d21b2b1343040ecb85db0e354a60e96a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/5/c85145af0b6431672968299c4d2f016270e22caf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B = 0$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/6/676dbd33bc90d38c93bb8278eaa43b69ec5c9215.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A+B=1+0=\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"195\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/7an5wU9Q5hk?t=3080\">https://youtu.be/7an5wU9Q5hk?t=3080</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y4DXkhYthhs\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y4DXkhYthhs</a>   ~David\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/IC_2SxI821c\">https://youtu.be/IC_2SxI821c</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8\" title=\"2006 AMC 8\">2006 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2006\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.